 bgslibrary  algorithms  
 
mixtureofgaussianv1  mixtureofgaussianv1     
  ibgs quote mixtureofgaussianv1    
  alpha 0 05   enablethreshold threshold 15  
  
  debug construction mixtureofgaussianv1   
  initloadsaveconfig algorithmname   
  
 
mixtureofgaussianv1   mixtureofgaussianv1     
  debug destruction mixtureofgaussianv1 mixtureofgaussianv1  process cv  mat  img input  cv  mat  img output  cv  mat  img bgmodel  
  
  init img input  img output  img bgmodel   
 
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
 
  mog img input  img foreground  alpha   
  mog getbackgroundimage img background enablethreshold  
    cv  threshold img foreground  img foreground  threshold  255  cv  thresh binary img foreground empty    
    img foreground   cv  mat  zeros img input size    img input type img background empty    
    img background   cv  mat  zeros img input size    img input type showoutput    
    cv  imshow algorithmname     fg   img foreground   
    cv  imshow algorithmname     bg   img background   
    
  
 
  img foreground copyto img output   
  img background copyto img bgmodel   
 
  firsttime mixtureofgaussianv1  save config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs     alpha     alpha  
  fs     enablethreshold     enablethreshold  
  fs     threshold     threshold  
  fs     showoutput     showoutput mixtureofgaussianv1  load config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs  alpha      alpha  
  fs  enablethreshold      enablethreshold  
  fs  threshold      threshold  
  fs  showoutput      showoutput  
  
 
